([PROGRAM 2: Transistor BJT Output Characteristic Curves Plotter]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Context: Model and plot Common Emitter BJT output characteristic curves \(IC vs) Tj
T*
(VCE\) across varying base currents IB using Matplotlib.) Tj
T*
(Python Source Code:) Tj
T*
(import matplotlib.pyplot as plt) Tj
T*
(import numpy as np) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Collector-Emitter Voltage sweep from 0 to 12 Volts) Tj
T*
(v_ce = np.linspace\(0, 12, 500\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Varying Base Currents in microAmperes) Tj
T*
(i_b_list = [10, 20, 30, 40, 50] # uA) Tj
T*
(beta = 100 # Common Emitter Current Gain) Tj
T*
(v_sat = 0.3 # Saturation voltage) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(plt.figure\(figsize=\(9, 5\)\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(for i_b in i_b_list:) Tj
T*
(i_c_active = \(beta * i_b * 1e-3\) # mA) Tj
T*
(# Saturation model: exponential rise to active region) Tj
T*
(i_c = i_c_active * \(1 - np.exp\(-v_ce / v_sat\)\) + 0.05 * v_ce) Tj
T*
(plt.plot\(v_ce, i_c, label=f'IB = {i_b} uA'\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(plt.title\('BJT Common Emitter Output Characteristics \(IC vs VCE\)', fontsize=12,) Tj
T*
(fontweight='bold'\)) Tj
T*
(plt.xlabel\('Collector-Emitter Voltage V_CE \(Volts\)', fontsize=10\)) Tj
T*
(plt.ylabel\('Collector Current I_C \(mA\)', fontsize=10\)) Tj
T*
(plt.axvline\(x=0.3, color='red', linestyle='--', alpha=0.7, label='Saturation Boundary'\)) Tj
T*
(plt.grid\(True, linestyle=':', alpha=0.6\)) Tj
T*
(plt.legend\(loc='upper left'\)) Tj
T*
(plt.tight_layout\(\)) Tj
T*
(# plt.savefig\('bjt_characteristics.png', dpi=300\)) Tj
T*
(print\('Plot configured and styled successfully.'\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
([PROGRAM 3: Multi-Subplot Electrical Waveform Visualization]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
