([PROGRAM 4: Resistor Quality Control Tolerance Distribution Histogram]) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
/F2 9.5 Tf
(-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
/F1 9 Tf
(Problem Context: Analyze manufacturing variability of 10 kOhm precision resistors by) Tj
T*
(plotting frequency distribution histogram and calculating yield within +/- 2% tolerance.) Tj
T*
(Python Source Code:) Tj
T*
(import numpy as np) Tj
T*
(import pandas as pd) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(# Simulate batch of 10,000 manufacturing samples \(Mean=10000 Ohm, Std=120 Ohm\)) Tj
T*
(np.random.seed\(101\)) Tj
T*
